  "Same scrcpy stream, but it plays in DroidDock's own pop-out instead of a separate scrcpy window — and needs no “Allow screen capture” tap on the phone.": "Aliran scrcpy yang sama, tapi diputar di jendela pop-out milik DroidDock, bukan jendela scrcpy terpisah — dan tidak perlu ketukan “Izinkan perekaman layar” di ponsel.",
