  "Saving from any Mac app writes straight to the phone. Finder's own droppings (.DS_Store and ._ sidecars) are discarded rather than stored. Moving a file between folders isn't supported — rename in place, or use the Files tab.": "Menyimpan dari aplikasi Mac mana pun langsung menulis ke ponsel. Berkas sisa buatan Finder (.DS_Store dan berkas pendamping ._) dibuang, bukan disimpan. Memindahkan berkas antarfolder tidak didukung — ganti namanya di tempat, atau gunakan tab Berkas.",
